{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52364","headline":"回波乐 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回波[尔]（来）时[六]（大）（均从任校）贼，不如持心断惑。\n纵使诵经千卷，眼里见经不识。\n不解佛法大意，徒劳排文数黑。\n头陀兰若精进，希望後世功德。\n持心即是大患，圣道何由可克。\n若悟生死之（任校作「如」）梦，一切求心皆息。\n（按：原卷此首前题「王梵志回波乐」六字，以下连抄。\n任谓此首及以下六皆属《回波乐》之作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}